{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q25", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在哪一年意外受伤大腿骨折？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字辛亥 壬辰 丁卯 戊申，日主丁火生于辰月，官杀旺盛，得卯木印星贴身生扶，但时柱戊申伤官生财，财又生官杀，日主偏弱。局中金木交战之象隐伏（卯申暗合，金克木），时支申金为下肢腿脚部位。逢寅年，寅申相冲引动金木大战，易有筋骨伤灾。\n\n2010年庚寅，天干庚金透出，为白虎血光之星，支下寅申冲战激烈。大运戊子，子卯无礼之刑，刑入日支，且运支子水七杀逢流年庚金相生，杀旺攻身。流年天干庚金盖头克寅木印星，印星严重受损，寅木为肝胆四肢，受旺金所伤，正应大腿骨折之象。1998年戊寅虽有伤官见官，但金未透干；2018年戊戌无金木冲战；2022年壬寅木旺水泄，冲战缓和。故2010年最为应验。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19710412_P005-Q25", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 87826, "response_id": "27c87703-602c-431d-be0f-6a0fca735090", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 211, "completion_tokens": 4990, "total_tokens": 5201, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4727}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 83}}
